# Deploy scratch
*.tmp
/tmp/

# Design mockups.
#
# These embed the Radio's stock bb_encore.png wallpaper as a base64 data URI so
# they render offline. That artwork is Logitech / Slim Devices firmware, and
# publishing it here would be redistributing it — so the mockups stay local.
#
# Nothing is lost from the applet: it loads that wallpaper from the device at
# runtime and ships no copy of it.
design/*.html
